1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:03,000
your ai says the bot works.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,940
the button does nothing.

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:06,870
graea taps it, screenshots it,

4
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:08,090
and reads it.

5
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:10,560
it logs every step in duckdb.

6
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:13,930
it tells your ai exactly what broke and where.

7
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,410
the ai fixes it.

8
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:16,780
graea checks again.

9
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:18,090
run one, three failures.

10
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,540
run three, all pass.

11
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,160
no human relaying screenshots.

12
00:00:23,038 --> 00:00:25,208
graea, source available.

13
00:00:25,458 --> 00:00:26,828
usufruct licensing.

14
00:00:26,958 --> 00:00:28,788
ufl all the way.

